    <node id="hexchat/hexchat#816">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Improve SSL cert handling</data>
      <data key="d3">Currently you can only blindly accept invalid certificates for networks so some improvements on notifying the user and accepting invalid certificates would be nice.

This is being developed in the [sslalerts](https://github.com/hexchat/hexchat/commits/sslalert) branch.

When complete this should close #261 #524 #554
## Goals

(to be improved, opinions welcomed)
- [x] UI to alert users and show cert info
- [x] Save fingerprint to trust next time
</data>
