      <data key="d2">Invalid memory read on zip file in function trad_enc_decrypt_update() after entering empty password</data>
      <data key="d3">Original [issue 415](https://code.google.com/p/libarchive/issues/detail?id=415) created by Google Code user `hanno@hboeck.de` on 2015-03-06T11:03:58.000Z:

```
bsdtar will detect the attached zip file as password protected. When entering nothing (just press enter) it will cause an invalid memory read access.

Found with american fuzzy lop.

