      <data key="d2">Limit maximum response size</data>
      <data key="d3">Superagent buffers and uncompresses responses in memory. Malicious server could send extremely large response causing superagent to use excessive amounts of memory.

I suggest adding a way to set a maximum response size, and have a default limit set.</data>
