https://github.com/arnobl/latexdraw/blob/9a33fb9a07e29fe1c4efb9cf6cb6ad5bf0d7a832/latexdraw-core/net.sf.latexdraw/src/main/java/net/sf/latexdraw/parsers/svg/SVGDocument.java#L87-L90

