    <node id="vim-syntastic/syntastic#2179">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Configuration file look up doesn't work since commit 6d7c0b3</data>
      <data key="d3">Since commit 6d7c0b3 _Security: clear defaults for config file names (cf. #2170)._  **syntastic_&lt;file_type&gt;_config** files (syntastic_cpp_config in my case) are ignored.</data>
