      <data key="d2">stack buffer over flow inside jsvGetString</data>
      <data key="d3">We found some buffer overflows against commit c36d30529118aa049797db43f111ddad468aad29 in `jsvGetString` src/jsvar.c:1194 with address sanitizer. Till now, all these crashes involve the arrow function parsing. We haven't digged into the root cause yet, but we reduced the test input as:

