      <data key="d1">java</data>
      <data key="d2">WebSocket upgrade request body limit</data>
      <data key="d3">CVE-2018-12541: The WebSocket HTTP upgrade implementation buffers the full http request before doing the handshake, holding the entire request body in memory. There should be a reasonnable limit (8192 bytes) above which the WebSocket gets an HTTP response with the 413 status code and the connection gets closed. </data>
