      <data key="d3">CVE-2018-12542: The StaticHandler uses external input to construct a pathname that should be within a restricted directory, but it does not properly neutralize '\' (backward slashes) sequences that can resolve to a location that is outside of that directory when running on Windows Operating Systems. This was reported by Vishwanath Viraktamath &lt;vviraktamath@vmware.com&gt;</data>
