      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">Another trigger position of XSS</data>
      <data key="d3">I'm using the latest version (2018/07/05)

1. new notes, select Markdown, write payload:

&lt;img src= "test" onerror=alert ('test') &gt;

It's not going to trigger now.

2. when I need to highlight the markdown code, I write it before the code.

" ``` "

I trigger xss. when I enter third.



Boostnote is great!



</data>
