    <node id="CVE-2018-14718">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">java</data>
      <data key="d2">Block more classes from polymorphic deserialization (CVE-2018-14718 - CVE-2018-14721)</data>
      <data key="d3">This issue covers following CVEs related to polymorphic deserialization, gadgets:

* CVE-2018-14718: RCE with slf4j-ext jar
* CVE-2018-14719: RCE with blaze-ds-opt, -core jars
* CVE-2018-14720: exfiltration/XXE with only JDK classes (some JDK versions)
* CVE-2018-14721: exfiltration/SSRF with axis2-jaxws

Original vulnerability discoverer:
吴桂雄  Wuguixiong

-----

Fixed in:

* 2.9.7 and later
* 2.8.11.3
* 2.7.9.5
* 2.6.7.3
</data>
    </node>
