    <node id="CVE-2018-16367">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">There is an incorrect access control vulnerability that can write file anywhere</data>
      <data key="d3">The online Judge's sandbox have an incorrect access control vulnerability that can write file anywhere.
User can get the directory list and write it to /tmp. At last user can leak file data by #include

such as:
```C++
#include "/tmp/datafile"
```

There is my test submit: 
[creat file](https://qduoj.com/status/4e2df90b1ec6707cc5da3bac91daa596)
[leak data](https://qduoj.com/status/853fb93178864da2e3a0339e6eb897ef)</data>
    </node>
    <node id="QingdaoU/OnlineJudge#165">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">There is an incorrect access control vulnerability that can write file anywhere</data>
      <data key="d3">The online Judge's sandbox have an incorrect access control vulnerability that can write file anywhere.
User can get the directory list and write it to /tmp. At last user can leak file data by #include

such as:
```C++
#include "/tmp/datafile"
```

There is my test submit: 
[creat file](https://qduoj.com/status/4e2df90b1ec6707cc5da3bac91daa596)
[leak data](https://qduoj.com/status/853fb93178864da2e3a0339e6eb897ef)</data>
