      <data key="d2">AddressSanitizer: stack-buffer-overflow at lou_translateString.c:358</data>
      <data key="d3">`lou_translate` may suffer from a stack-buffer-overflow on a stack variable `inbuf` defined in `translate_input`.
Relevant files are available [here](https://github.com/ntu-sec/pocs/tree/master/liblouis-81fe3c74/crashes).

Command lines to trigger the crashes:
```
lou_translate hu-hu-g2.ctb &lt; so_lou_translateString.c:358_1
