      <data key="d2">Stack-buffer-overflow in Function mxml_write_node</data>
      <data key="d3">I used **clang 6.0 and AddressSanitizer**  to build **[mxml 2.12](https://github.com/michaelrsweet/mxml)**, this [file](https://github.com/fouzhe/security/blob/master/mxml/Stack-buffer-overflow-mxml_write_node) can cause stack buffer overflow in function mxml_write_node in mxml-file.c when executing this command:

```shell
./testmxml $crash 1.xml
```

