    <node id="CVE-2018-20226">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">Wrong checks of role when an user is created</data>
      <data key="d3">### Request Type
Bug

### Work Environment
Cortex 2.1.2

### Problem Description
The role of the user being created is not correctly check according to the role of the creating user. This implies that an organization admin is able create a super admin.

Thank you, Po-Hsing Wu.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TheHive-Project/Cortex#158">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Wrong checks of role when an user is created</data>
      <data key="d3">### Request Type
Bug

### Work Environment
Cortex 2.1.2

### Problem Description
The role of the user being created is not correctly check according to the role of the creating user. This implies that an organization admin is able create a super admin.

Thank you, Po-Hsing Wu.</data>
