      <data key="d2">OOB issue of gf_text_get_utf8_line</data>
      <data key="d3">In gf_text_get_utf8_line  function, gf_utf8_wcstombs  return -1 with crafted srt file, it will cause szLineConv[i] = 0 out of bound write

