    <node id="CVE-2018-9275">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">c</data>
      <data key="d2">Authfile Leaking File Descriptor </data>
      <data key="d3">When the authfile is successfully opened, the file descriptor is not closed and leaks file descriptors. The file descriptor should be closed after this line; https://github.com/Yubico/yubico-pam/blob/master/util.c#L177


```sh
$ lsof /path/to/authfile | wc -l
8
# Login to the system using yubico-pam a few more times
$ lsof /path/to/authfile | wc -l
25
```</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Yubico/yubico-pam#136">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Authfile Leaking File Descriptor </data>
