      <data key="d2">Divide by zero in ParseDsdiffHeaderConfig()</data>
      <data key="d3">[divzero.wav.zip](https://github.com/dbry/WavPack/files/2922588/divzero.wav.zip) - Contains fuzzed input

Running ` cli/wavpack divzero.wav` with `divzero.wav` extracted from the attachment triggers a SIGFPE due to divide by zero in [`ParseDsdiffHeaderConfig (dsdiff.c:282)`](https://github.com/dbry/WavPack/blob/8948be9fd118cd3646eb83c9bc10afca478b0e32/cli/dsdiff.c#L282).</data>
