      break;
  }
  quantum_info=DestroyQuantumInfo(quantum_info);
  (void) CloseBlob(image);
  return(status);
```

We should call `ThrowWriterException(CorruptImageError,"UnableToWriteImageData");` when condition `y &lt; (ssize_t) image-&gt;rows` satisfies behind for-loop.

See commit https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/f1cc2eb986dc8f4a7727bce689a17566f896fde6 for more details.


