      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">c</data>
      <data key="d2">Multiple crashes when parsing MP4 files</data>
      <data key="d3">As of e27b702, when running `./gpmf-parser $FILE`, it may report with crashes when building with AddressSanitizer.

We basically applied some fuzzing to detect these issues, with the initial seeds from the `samples` directory. The POC files are wrapped with zip compression for upload.

Please see below for details.
</data>
