      <data key="d2">heap-buffer-overflow in gb18030_mbc_enc_len</data>
      <data key="d3">In gb18030_mbc_enc_len, p ++ then p is dereferenced without checking if it passes the end of string, which leads to heap-buffer-overflow.
```
static int
gb18030_mbc_enc_len(const UChar* p)
{
  if (GB18030_MAP[*p] != CM)
    return 1;

  p++;
  if (GB18030_MAP[*p] == C4)
    return 4;

  return 2;
}
```
