      <data key="d1">c</data>
      <data key="d2">Deny of Service caused by dividing zero without sanity check in jfif.c</data>
      <data key="d3">file: jfif.c function: jfif_decode line: 425

    mcuw = sfh_max * 8;
    mcuh = sfv_max * 8;
    jw = ALIGN(jfif-&gt;width , mcuw);
    jh = ALIGN(jfif-&gt;height, mcuh);
    mcuc = jw / mcuw;                              &lt;------- mcuw can be zero
    mcur = jh / mcuh;
    //-- calculate mcu info</data>
