Edit

This bug issue still exists in latest version 0.8.0: 4c19ae5 and 0.9.0: 1de1f8d

---

Addition: This bug was found with our fuzzer, which is based on AFL. Our fuzzer is developed by Yuanpingyu(cfenicey@gmail.com) 、Yanhao and Marsman1996(lqliuyuwei@outlook.com)</data>
