Response                         Time (ms)     Location
Executable search path is: 
ModLoad: 000f0000 000fb000   image000f0000
ModLoad: 77e00000 77f99000   ntdll.dll
ModLoad: 60ee0000 60f43000   C:\WINDOWS\System32\verifier.dll
