      <data key="d2">Block one more gadget type (apache-drill, CVE-2020-14060)</data>
      <data key="d3">Another gadget type(s) reported regarding class(es) of  `org.apache.drill.exec:drill-jdbc-all`. library.
See https://medium.com/@cowtowncoder/on-jackson-cves-dont-panic-here-is-what-you-need-to-know-54cd0d6e8062 for description of the general problem.

Mitre id: CVE-2020-14060
Reporter(s): Topsec(tcc) from Alphalab Security Team

Fix is included in:

* 2.9.10.5
* Not considered valid CVE for Jackson 2.10.0 and later (see https://medium.com/@cowtowncoder/jackson-2-10-safe-default-typing-2d018f0ce2ba)
</data>
