      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">c</data>
      <data key="d2">Invalid free wild pointer lead to DOS in load_png in loader.c</data>
      <data key="d3">`load_png` has a pointer `rows`, which should be set to NULL, otherwise `cleanup` code would use(calling `free`) it.

binary: img2sixel
file: loader.c
function: load_png

poc:
[poc.zip](https://github.com/saitoha/libsixel/files/4464131/poc.zip)


result:
```
