      <data key="d2">NULL Pointer Deference vulnerability in find_color_or_error function</data>
      <data key="d3">In support.c [line 1110](https://github.com/kohler/gifsicle/blob/1aa87745d2caf6675397b9299960a203be9a71f0/src/support.c#L1110), The gfcm could be a NULL pointer in some cases.
Here is the usage:
gifsicle -t 1 test.gif -o test1.gif
POC here:
