      <data key="d2">heap overflow when parsing `MMS_BIT_STRING` in MmsValue_decodeMmsData in mms/iso_mms/server/mms_access_result.c</data>
      <data key="d3">When libiec61850 parsing type `MMS_BIT_STRING`, it doesn't check variable `bufPos`. So we can provide a larger number for `bufPos`, then memory copy from `buffer` + `bufPos` + 1 lead to heap overflow.
