    <node id="CVE-2021-23371">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">How to improve parsing performance?</data>
      <data key="d3">Hi there,

I need to write a program, which parses many dates in different formats.

I've encountered a performance issue with `chrono`. Here's a benchmark, which demonstrates the issues:

```js
const chrono = require("chrono-node")
let max = 100000;

console.time("chrono parsing");
for (let i = 0; i &lt; max; i++) {
  chrono.en.strict.parseDate("11/12/2021");
}
console.timeEnd("chrono parsing");

console.time("native parsing");
for (let i = 0; i &lt; max; i++) {
  new Date("11/12/2021");
}
console.timeEnd("native parsing");
``` 

The output is:

```
chrono parsing: 34.235s
native parsing: 62.26ms
```

I understand that `chrono` does much more than the native parsing and it's understandable that it's slower. However 500 times slower seems a bit too much.

Is there a way to speed up `chrono`? Can I disable some patterns or locales to speed it up?</data>
    </node>
    <node id="wanasit/chrono#380">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">How to improve parsing performance?</data>
      <data key="d3">Hi there,

I need to write a program, which parses many dates in different formats.

I've encountered a performance issue with `chrono`. Here's a benchmark, which demonstrates the issues:

```js
const chrono = require("chrono-node")
let max = 100000;

console.time("chrono parsing");
for (let i = 0; i &lt; max; i++) {
  chrono.en.strict.parseDate("11/12/2021");
}
console.timeEnd("chrono parsing");

console.time("native parsing");
for (let i = 0; i &lt; max; i++) {
  new Date("11/12/2021");
}
console.timeEnd("native parsing");
``` 

The output is:

```
chrono parsing: 34.235s
native parsing: 62.26ms
```

I understand that `chrono` does much more than the native parsing and it's understandable that it's slower. However 500 times slower seems a bit too much.

Is there a way to speed up `chrono`? Can I disable some patterns or locales to speed it up?</data>
