OS : macOS Catalina 10.15.5(19F101) MacBook Pro (Retina, 13-inch, Early 2015)
compiler: Apple clang version 11.0.0 (clang-1100.0.33.17)

Install from snap or download  mac dmg  don't crash for this testcase.


