1. `sems_nsems` can be an arbitrary large number
https://github.com/karelzak/util-linux/blob/8344a81f7a726cef4640f9368bd6728eff6987bc/sys-utils/ipcutils.c#L272

2. Call to `get_sem_elements` with the structure
https://github.com/karelzak/util-linux/blob/8344a81f7a726cef4640f9368bd6728eff6987bc/sys-utils/ipcutils.c#L217

3. Call to `calloc` with the large integer can cause a memory allocation with an overflowed size
https://github.com/karelzak/util-linux/blob/8344a81f7a726cef4640f9368bd6728eff6987bc/sys-utils/ipcutils.c#L224</data>
