      <data key="d2">heap-use-after-free in libsixel/src/dither.c:379</data>
      <data key="d3">Hi,I found a heap-use-after-free in the current master [fb32912](https://github.com/libsixel/libsixel/commit/fb329124fd4bce693d3fc57447b0b40f62d9f090)
