    <node id="CVE-2015-8857">
      <data key="d0">CVE</data>
      <data key="d1">javascript</data>
      <data key="d2">uglify -c changes behavior of mdast code</data>
      <data key="d3">I've created a repo to reproduce this bug: https://github.com/tmcw/mdast-uglify-bug

For the [mdast](https://github.com/wooorm/mdast) markdown library, the source succeeds when not uglified, and then, passed through `uglify -c`, its behavior changes and it breaks.

I'm trying to dig through the source, passed through `uglify -c` and then `uglify -b`, in order to track down the cause. It's quite a doozy
</data>
    </node>
